* text=auto
# Windows launcher must keep CRLF, the macOS one LF (bash chokes on \r).
*.cmd     text eol=crlf
*.command text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
# Site sources: LF everywhere (the build also normalizes them, lib/build.mjs lf()).
site/**/*.js   text eol=lf
site/**/*.css  text eol=lf
site/**/*.html text eol=lf
site/**/*.txt  text eol=lf
# Written by the admin, not by people: no conversion at all, the working tree is byte for byte the
# repo (always LF). With text=auto Windows checked these out as CRLF, the admin wrote them back as
# LF, and git reports a file whose size changed as modified without comparing content: permanent
# "Nepublikované změny" for data/gallery.json, docs/CNAME, docs/assets/fonts/OFL.txt.
data/**        -text
docs/**        -text
*.webp binary
*.jpg  binary
*.png  binary
